WEBVTT

00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:21.750
Like this?

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:23.410
Your underwear, too.

00:00:23.710 --> 00:00:26.250
M-My underwear, too?!

00:00:26.250 --> 00:00:27.840
Are you going to keep me waiting?

00:00:27.840 --> 00:00:29.460
R-Right...

00:02:21.450 --> 00:02:24.200
Ymir-sama, what's that?

00:02:24.830 --> 00:02:28.540
It's the hyper-vibration suit that you will wear.

00:02:28.830 --> 00:02:31.460
Hyper-vibration suit? What does that mean?

00:02:31.920 --> 00:02:34.170
The suit uses the power of hyper-vibration crystals

00:02:34.170 --> 00:02:36.260
to create a special type of force field that

00:02:36.260 --> 00:02:40.260
will deflect any attack. It's the ultimate armour.

00:02:40.260 --> 00:02:45.390
What? Y-You can't make me a warrior!

00:02:45.390 --> 00:02:46.720
You're doing this for your family, right?

00:02:51.900 --> 00:02:53.560
We're going to start the experiment.

00:02:53.980 --> 00:02:54.770
Okay...

00:03:07.370 --> 00:03:09.580
The crystals in that armour vibrate stronger

00:03:09.580 --> 00:03:12.710
relative to the strength of an attack made against it,

00:03:12.710 --> 00:03:15.000
producing a more powerful force field.

00:03:15.000 --> 00:03:17.590
What should I do...

00:03:17.920 --> 00:03:20.510
All you have to do is just stand there.

00:03:32.690 --> 00:03:34.230
Okay, here goes!

00:03:50.330 --> 00:03:52.160
I wouldn't have expected less from Shian's,

00:03:52.160 --> 00:03:54.290
the great alchemist's, wizard stone.

00:03:54.290 --> 00:03:59.250
This girl's ability to withstand its power is also quite impressive,

00:03:59.710 --> 00:04:01.630
but she might be a little too sensitive.

00:04:03.050 --> 00:04:05.180
I can't take it!

00:04:07.050 --> 00:04:09.100
The plan to create the strongest warrior on the continent,

00:04:09.100 --> 00:04:10.680
using all the knowledge and

00:04:10.680 --> 00:04:12.850
technology available to us at Iron Mountain,

00:04:13.350 --> 00:04:17.150
has finally produced its first test subject.

00:04:17.810 --> 00:04:20.780
The Hyper Vibration Valkyrie, Mirim.

00:04:25.570 --> 00:04:28.410
Extra! Extra!

00:04:28.410 --> 00:04:31.330
We've got tons of big stories happening here!

00:04:31.700 --> 00:04:33.620
Is the strange light that people have

00:04:33.620 --> 00:04:35.120
spotted all throughout the lands really

00:04:35.120 --> 00:04:38.000
caused by the strongest warrior, a person from the moon?!

00:04:39.040 --> 00:04:41.460
In the Calibara back-country and a mist covered jungle,

00:04:41.460 --> 00:04:44.720
an expedition chases the rare Cassy creature!

00:04:46.050 --> 00:04:48.510
And listen to this!

00:04:48.510 --> 00:04:50.760
The Queen might have illegitimate children!

00:04:50.760 --> 00:04:52.470
Here, the story of the triplet sisters,

00:04:52.470 --> 00:04:53.890
born on the Night of Thunder.

00:04:55.060 --> 00:04:58.230
Make sure you buy a copy to learn more!

00:05:03.360 --> 00:05:07.490
The masses want big stories like those, Vante.

00:05:08.620 --> 00:05:13.870
So it's my job to provide things like that.

00:05:13.870 --> 00:05:17.210
I don't know if I'd call it honest journalism, though.

00:05:19.000 --> 00:05:21.380
Anyway, we got to get ourselves

00:05:21.380 --> 00:05:23.260
to Gainos and find Mirim.

00:05:26.300 --> 00:05:28.140
What's... that?

00:05:31.810 --> 00:05:33.890
I've finally caught up to you...

00:05:33.890 --> 00:05:36.810
fated one from my premonitions.

00:05:37.560 --> 00:05:40.310
You're wanted! Surrender now!

00:05:42.650 --> 00:05:45.070
Now I just have to pretend like I ran into her here

00:05:45.070 --> 00:05:47.150
and have a little fateful reunion.

00:05:50.780 --> 00:05:54.040
Lun lun. Lun lun.

00:05:52.950 --> 00:05:54.040
Hey, you there.

00:05:54.950 --> 00:05:57.500
You've got some weird things coming out of you.

00:05:57.500 --> 00:05:59.500
Mind if I get some more information for my—

00:05:58.460 --> 00:05:59.500
Wait!

00:06:01.290 --> 00:06:02.250
Huh?

00:06:04.710 --> 00:06:06.800
O-Onii-chan?!

00:06:08.340 --> 00:06:10.140
Wait! Wait, you!

00:06:10.800 --> 00:06:12.470
Onii-chan!

00:06:13.560 --> 00:06:14.770
Onii-chan?

00:06:14.770 --> 00:06:16.140
Stranger!

00:06:16.560 --> 00:06:19.190
Are you an accomplice?!

00:06:19.190 --> 00:06:22.060
Why did it turn out this way?!

00:06:24.230 --> 00:06:25.980
The ultimate armour?

00:06:29.280 --> 00:06:32.370
That's correct. She has a weapon, as well.

00:06:32.370 --> 00:06:34.120
It's the ultimate weapon.

00:06:34.120 --> 00:06:37.120
It predicts the enemy's movements and attacks automatically.

00:06:37.120 --> 00:06:39.790
The hyper-vibration sword, the Infinite Slasher,

00:06:40.330 --> 00:06:42.000
and the hyper-vibration shield.

00:06:46.800 --> 00:06:48.970
You will now witness the perfection

00:06:48.970 --> 00:06:50.550
of my perfect plan,

00:06:51.010 --> 00:06:52.050
my Queen.

00:06:52.930 --> 00:06:55.010
Queen?

00:06:57.770 --> 00:06:59.230
Perfection?

00:06:59.230 --> 00:07:02.060
I don't think this'll actually be useful in combat.

00:07:02.480 --> 00:07:05.230
Elina, you want to give it a shot?

00:07:06.270 --> 00:07:07.900
Sounds like fun.

00:07:09.780 --> 00:07:10.650
Wait.

00:07:13.320 --> 00:07:14.320
Stand.

00:07:15.160 --> 00:07:16.240
Understood.

00:07:46.570 --> 00:07:47.860
Wow.

00:07:47.860 --> 00:07:50.190
She took a hit from Onee-sama's sword and isn't hurt.

00:07:55.740 --> 00:07:59.790
I-I can't stand any longer...

00:08:06.460 --> 00:08:08.210
They're not over here!

00:08:12.760 --> 00:08:14.970
Yuit, we're safe now.

00:08:15.470 --> 00:08:18.970
I was surprised that you're actually a girl, Onii-chan.

00:08:19.260 --> 00:08:22.480
So stop calling me Onii-chan.

00:08:22.480 --> 00:08:24.850
No, I won't stop.

00:08:24.850 --> 00:08:28.770
It wouldn't be logical to call you something different.

00:08:30.280 --> 00:08:31.400
Onii-chan...

00:08:32.440 --> 00:08:34.780
I missed you so much, Onii-chan.

00:08:34.780 --> 00:08:36.660
I get it. I get it.

00:08:36.660 --> 00:08:37.910
Onii-chan...

00:08:44.660 --> 00:08:45.870
Do whatever you want.

00:08:46.920 --> 00:08:51.000
I thought I'd never see you again.

00:08:52.960 --> 00:08:54.090
The day...

00:08:55.630 --> 00:08:58.470
The day I left the Kreutz castle.

00:09:04.640 --> 00:09:09.980
I wanted to say goodbye, but it didn't work out.

00:09:14.860 --> 00:09:16.110
I'm sorry.

00:09:16.110 --> 00:09:18.410
No, it's okay.

00:09:18.410 --> 00:09:21.450
I'm here with you now.

00:09:23.160 --> 00:09:24.200
Yuit...

00:09:32.250 --> 00:09:35.220
Now I have to go find Nee-sama again.

00:09:43.770 --> 00:09:47.560
I can't be a warrior!

00:09:47.560 --> 00:09:49.980
I'm the only one who can remove that armour.

00:09:54.030 --> 00:09:57.150
Y-Ymir-sama... I...

00:09:57.150 --> 00:10:00.160
If you quit now, I won't pay you anything.

00:10:07.660 --> 00:10:09.040
Good.

00:10:11.040 --> 00:10:12.290
Ymir-sama!

00:10:13.040 --> 00:10:15.210
What is it? You're so loud.

00:10:15.630 --> 00:10:18.720
The scouting party that just came back

00:10:18.720 --> 00:10:22.760
reported that Annelotte had been spotted near Sorol.

00:10:22.760 --> 00:10:26.890
Oh! This is a perfect chance for a test in real battle.

00:10:27.430 --> 00:10:29.350
The automaton and her owner are

00:10:29.350 --> 00:10:31.020
also reported to be with her.

00:10:32.940 --> 00:10:34.520
Yuit-chan?

00:10:37.490 --> 00:10:41.070
We should prepare to depart immediately.

00:11:05.010 --> 00:11:07.520
You think you can run away from me?

00:11:23.200 --> 00:11:25.700
I know I need the money,

00:11:25.700 --> 00:11:29.580
but if that means fighting Yuit-chan...

00:11:29.580 --> 00:11:30.910
It's a beautiful warrior!

00:11:30.910 --> 00:11:32.170
Open the way!

00:11:32.170 --> 00:11:33.830
She's so pretty.

00:11:38.300 --> 00:11:39.880
That hurt...

00:11:55.520 --> 00:11:57.190
My body isn't moving

00:11:57.190 --> 00:11:59.940
like I want it to because of the armour...

00:12:00.400 --> 00:12:01.780
Are you all right?

00:12:18.040 --> 00:12:22.010
I don't know what I should do...

00:12:23.590 --> 00:12:26.340
God saves all.

00:12:26.890 --> 00:12:28.430
Please, tell me what is bothering you.

00:12:30.430 --> 00:12:31.600
Okay.

00:12:40.360 --> 00:12:42.530
Wherever you run,

00:12:42.530 --> 00:12:44.820
I can trace you by the emissions

00:12:44.820 --> 00:12:46.950
of the vibrations in the crystals.

00:12:50.580 --> 00:12:53.370
Well, actually...

00:12:55.870 --> 00:12:57.420
What's that sound?

00:12:58.380 --> 00:12:59.880
This is the...

00:13:10.180 --> 00:13:11.260
What's wrong?

00:13:12.220 --> 00:13:15.310
It started again!

00:13:21.780 --> 00:13:23.280
Are you...

00:13:23.280 --> 00:13:24.360
...possessed by a demon?

00:13:25.070 --> 00:13:28.160
Is this why you looked towards God for help?

00:13:29.070 --> 00:13:32.370
How dare you... Demon, you defy God!

00:13:32.740 --> 00:13:38.420
God, with your love, illuminate her with your light.

00:13:38.420 --> 00:13:39.540
Save her!

00:13:41.670 --> 00:13:45.880
It'll just get stronger if you do that...

00:13:47.300 --> 00:13:49.090
The demon's resisting?

00:13:50.010 --> 00:13:53.470
Demon come out from within her!

00:13:59.310 --> 00:14:03.360
Please don't hit me anymore!

00:14:04.360 --> 00:14:06.490
If you insist on staying...

00:14:06.900 --> 00:14:08.860
I will designate you a heretical element

00:14:08.860 --> 00:14:10.950
and burn you where you lie!

00:14:14.200 --> 00:14:15.450
Stop!

00:14:19.790 --> 00:14:21.920
So this is where you were...

00:14:23.380 --> 00:14:25.090
I'll be taking her back.

00:14:35.350 --> 00:14:36.470
Wait.

00:14:38.350 --> 00:14:40.980
This is a sacred church.

00:14:40.980 --> 00:14:43.110
I can't have you doing whatever you please

00:14:43.110 --> 00:14:45.320
without the permission of the Head Ministry.

00:14:45.610 --> 00:14:48.780
Inquisitor Sigui...

00:14:48.780 --> 00:14:53.740
Then I ask you, will you please let me have her?

00:14:59.910 --> 00:15:02.750
Mirim, come here.

00:15:08.420 --> 00:15:09.760
Why are you...

00:15:13.390 --> 00:15:14.680
We're heading out.

00:15:15.220 --> 00:15:18.640
We're going to defeat Annelotte, who defies the Queen!

00:15:19.100 --> 00:15:20.140
Okay...

00:15:21.140 --> 00:15:22.440
Annelotte...

00:15:25.860 --> 00:15:27.190
This is where we split paths.

00:15:27.480 --> 00:15:30.530
Are you going far away again?

00:15:30.530 --> 00:15:31.150
Yeah.

00:15:32.450 --> 00:15:33.950
What are you going to do?

00:15:34.370 --> 00:15:37.540
I'm going to the Queen's capital, Gainos.

00:15:38.830 --> 00:15:39.790
Gainos?

00:15:40.250 --> 00:15:41.960
I'm going to find my friend who was

00:15:41.960 --> 00:15:44.540
taken away by the Iron Strategist, Ymir.

00:15:45.250 --> 00:15:47.250
I have to find my mother's wizard stone

00:15:47.250 --> 00:15:48.920
which was stolen, as well.

00:15:52.130 --> 00:15:53.380
Be careful.

00:15:53.760 --> 00:15:54.680
I will.

00:15:56.680 --> 00:15:57.600
See you.

00:15:59.020 --> 00:16:01.390
See you again, Onii-chan.

00:16:16.950 --> 00:16:18.990
Our troublemaker's gone now.

00:16:18.990 --> 00:16:22.710
Now I'll be able to have my fateful reunion with Nee-sama!

00:16:57.240 --> 00:16:59.240
I-I'm sorry!

00:16:59.240 --> 00:17:01.790
If I defeat you, my brothers

00:17:01.790 --> 00:17:05.620
will be able to eat all they want!

00:17:08.580 --> 00:17:10.880
I'm doing this for my mom!

00:17:13.130 --> 00:17:15.220
And for my brothers!

00:17:17.260 --> 00:17:20.180
Please surrender!

00:17:28.440 --> 00:17:35.700
If you don't surrender now, I'll...

00:17:36.900 --> 00:17:40.160
W-What's going on?

00:17:40.740 --> 00:17:43.450
The more power I put into my attacks,

00:17:43.450 --> 00:17:45.080
the stronger she counters...

00:17:48.880 --> 00:17:50.420
When we find Mirim,

00:17:50.420 --> 00:17:52.880
I'm thinking of getting some good food to eat with her.

00:17:53.420 --> 00:17:55.420
I made a lot of sales today,

00:17:55.420 --> 00:17:57.260
so we should have plenty...

00:18:01.010 --> 00:18:04.640
I didn't get to give this to Onii-chan...

00:18:05.480 --> 00:18:09.770
I kept it with me so I could give it to her sometime...

00:18:14.440 --> 00:18:16.490
In the language of flowers,

00:18:16.490 --> 00:18:18.360
a camille means strength and pride.

00:18:18.360 --> 00:18:20.160
Perfect for Onii-chan.

00:18:34.420 --> 00:18:36.880
I can't...

00:18:40.800 --> 00:18:43.140
...take anymore!

00:18:49.480 --> 00:18:50.520
What?!

00:18:51.350 --> 00:18:52.110
No...

00:18:52.610 --> 00:18:56.190
No more!

00:19:03.910 --> 00:19:06.080
Time for our fateful meeting!

00:19:15.040 --> 00:19:16.050
Onii-chan?

00:19:17.050 --> 00:19:19.970
Vante, we're going to save Onii-chan!

00:19:24.600 --> 00:19:27.470
I'm... sorry...

00:19:27.470 --> 00:19:28.560
I'm sorry!

00:19:29.980 --> 00:19:31.640
Missile Punch!

00:19:40.360 --> 00:19:41.900
Mirim...

00:19:44.820 --> 00:19:48.080
I'm coming for you, Nee-sama!

00:19:59.380 --> 00:20:00.590
Yuit?!

00:20:03.300 --> 00:20:05.050
Why was Mirim...

00:20:11.020 --> 00:20:14.190
H-How did I end up here?

00:20:22.360 --> 00:20:24.320
Who was that warrior?

00:20:25.200 --> 00:20:26.280
She's...

00:20:27.160 --> 00:20:30.040
my friend, Mirim. The girl I was looking for.

00:20:31.250 --> 00:20:33.370
She's your friend, Yuit?

00:20:33.370 --> 00:20:36.580
Mirim wouldn't do something like that!

00:20:36.580 --> 00:20:39.420
She cares a lot about her family, she's kind...

00:20:39.420 --> 00:20:42.800
I'm sure she knew that Mirim needed money,

00:20:42.800 --> 00:20:43.760
and that's why...

00:20:44.680 --> 00:20:48.180
I bet that's why she stole the wizard stone, too.

00:20:49.760 --> 00:20:51.930
That strange power might have

00:20:51.930 --> 00:20:55.560
something to do with Shian-dono's wizard stone.

00:21:01.690 --> 00:21:04.200
All of it was for that...

00:21:06.410 --> 00:21:08.700
The Iron Strategist, Ymir.

00:21:11.040 --> 00:21:13.290
I will never forgive her.

00:21:22.920 --> 00:21:23.880
Let us go.

00:21:25.220 --> 00:21:26.380
To Gainos.

00:21:30.300 --> 00:21:31.220
Right!

00:23:10.990 --> 00:23:12.990
I never thought the Iron Strategist, Ymir-sama,

00:23:12.990 --> 00:23:15.620
would run an experiment with my body like this...

00:23:15.620 --> 00:23:19.580
I told her I could never be a warrior!

00:23:19.580 --> 00:23:22.330
If Annelotte-oneesama doesn't surrender soon,

00:23:22.330 --> 00:23:26.130
I won't be able to do this much longer!

00:23:26.960 --> 00:23:30.420
But I have to do my best for my mom and the others!

00:23:30.840 --> 00:23:33.510
Next time: "The Secret of the Castle at Gainos."

00:23:33.510 --> 00:23:36.010
Wait, she's all tied up.

00:23:36.010 --> 00:23:39.980
Is the Dragon Warrior... all into S&M?
